%% Luồng thanh toán & bàn giao (theo logic hiện tại của API)

sequenceDiagram
  participant KH as Khách
  participant API as Backend
  participant NV as Staff

  Note over NV: Đơn đã APPROVED, đang/thành IN_PROGRESS...

  NV->>API: complete-work(repairOrderId)
  Note over API: RepairOrder COMPLETED

  KH->>API: POST /customer/payments
  Note over API: Payment PENDING
  KH->>API: POST /customer/payments/id/complete
  Note over API: Payment COMPLETED

  NV->>API: handover(repairOrderId)
  Note over API: RepairOrder DELIVERED

  KH->>API: POST /customer/ratings
  Note over API: ServiceRating cho repairOrder
